   Recheck Cond: (col2 = 150)
   Heap Blocks: exact=50
   Buffers: shared hit=52
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on recno_vm_perf_idx2  (cost=0.00..4.66 rows=50 width=0) (actual rows=50.00 loops=1)
